{"id": "DfLz4E6o6XT", "title": "Video by vigyan_bhairav__", "description": "Method 2: The Middle State 🌬️⏸️🔱\n\nIn Method 1, we learned to FIND the pause between two breaths.\nIn Method 2, Bhairava teaches us to STAY in it.\n\nThe breath moves between two spaces:\n🫀 the inner space (antar akasha) in the heart\n🌌 the outer space (bahya akasha), twelve fingers beyond the nose, at Dvadashanta\n\nAt each space, before it returns, the breath rests for an instant. In that instant, its movement turns inward. The out-breath (prana) and the in-breath (apana) both seem to dissolve.\n\nYoga calls this kumbhaka. The Tantra calls it the middle state, madhya dasha.\n\n✨ What's different from Method 1?\nMethod 1 asks: \"Where is the gap?\"\nMethod 2 asks: \"What is here when nothing moves?\"\n\nSo don't just catch the pause. Rest in it. Don't rush back to the next breath. Notice that both breaths are absent, yet you are still here, aware.\n\n⚠️ The key: never hold the breath. Never force it. Simply watch, and on its own, the breath becomes still.\n\nAs this middle state deepens, Bhairava (Shiva) shines through, never separate from his power, Bhairavi (Shakti). Like fire and its heat, they are one. 🔥\n\nIn the stillness between two breaths, the divine reveals itself.\n\n🧘 Try it: watch a few breaths. At the next pause, let go of the breath and simply rest in the stillness. Comment 🕉️ if you felt it.\n\n📖 Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Dharana 2 (verse 25)\n⬅️ New here? Start with Method 1 on my page.\nFollow for one method at a time 🪷\n\n#VigyanBhairavTantra #VigyanBhairav #Bhairava #Bhairavi #Shiva #Shakti #Tantra #KashmirShaivism #Kumbhaka #MadhyaDasha #Pranayama #Prana #BreathAwareness #Meditation #Mindfulness #Stillness #InnerPeace #SpiritualAwakening #Consciousness #Yoga #Mahadev #HarHarMahadev #Ukiyoe #WoodblockPrint #MeditationReels #SpiritualReels #ReelsIndia", "channel": "vigyan_bhairav__", "uploader_id": "70392958166", "uploader": "Bhairav", "timestamp": 1793505289, "like_count": 4008, "comment_count": 26, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-983673597530503a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.644, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOIN-Dre7Tb_H6vUDDNtZDEmCweYmcMNeb-jMP4wVNeg4-vr5wp5y9IEQEXWpjdxLq-acNBQRs71wfcFJt6oUeEVw-3jTjfp0VP5UM.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrFHyov7cmnhQ9WCuhjtshfURek3OA6eIh4_PSV16RMWPC5PAeQTXZJ9PYxMoNXETTaIXUfPiVv8lp7IPfYF5WC&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=yqUPNqBUut4Q7kNvwEzvdfA&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=-YvLB4vwHtLjuIpjXfyUgQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSSYUxdciRZ3IFP1EDBnuCuORy6ZCHvFINFR4chRcc78A&oe=6AF416CE", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 55.644, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-983673597530503a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPWjWinE9OeZnP7HRGydnRrFbrkGJCkyaG3ZXSkhgVuSocg61HmnNH90IpbPUKZP-Yb1jOdZco92nOJttNF3qCckR5TmxkRJVOq9_0.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adq4nH6NKqYIwbPgbWk2xJgO2ha3kwCOhGfXAvsuUVyTMlMeBlFiuhGeyEp4tADdRFOpgRP0S2XzjCfK9PLtdG1g&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=xQa0fv2w6PQQ7kNvwGOTc